                        stdscr.nodelay(False)
                        draw()
                        continue
                    else:
                        # Put back? We consumed next key that was not Enter; we need to handle it? For simplicity, if next key exists, we will have lost it. So we push? We can't push, but we can handle Esc as quit regardless, and ignore next? Instead we should not consume if not Enter; we can use unget?
